-- ale_minimap v0.1 (based on game_minimap)

-- Google Maps-style map zoom
    -- The mouse cursor retains its world position while zooming

-- When hovered, the minimap won't auto-center on the player when you move
    -- Makes clicking a specific spot easy to do while walking

-- After dragging the minimap, auto-center is blocked for 1 second
    -- Allows you to walk freely while dragging the map as much as you want, to reveal the location you're looking for

-- The player's position is now updated in real-time on the fullscreen map

-- The fullscreen map now only covers the game viewport
    -- So you can still see messages, battle list, health, etc. while viewing the map

-- The fullscreen map can be toggled by Ctrl+M

-- Draws a "view box" on the map, indicating the size of the game window relative to the map


---- MINOR
-- Player position cross now keeps updating while dragging the map
